# 1024-node 8:1 oversubscribed 3-tier fat tree
# Paper setup: 800Gbps, 400ns switch latency, 600ns link latency
# k=16 with 8:1 OS at ToR: 8 down (hosts) + 1 up
Nodes 1024
Tiers 3
Podsize 64

Tier 0
Oversubscribed 8
Downlink_speed_Gbps 800
Radix_Down 8
Radix_Up 1
Downlink_Latency_ns 600
Switch_Latency_ns 400

Tier 1
Oversubscribed 1
Downlink_speed_Gbps 800
Radix_Down 8
Radix_Up 8
Downlink_Latency_ns 600
Switch_Latency_ns 400
Bundle 1

Tier 2
Downlink_speed_Gbps 800
Radix_Down 16
Downlink_Latency_ns 600
Switch_Latency_ns 400
Bundle 1
